claim.claim-text:
a. about 1-15 g/L of sodium chloride (NaCl);
b. about 5-20 g/L of disodium phosphate (Na<2>HPO<4>);
c. about 0.1-2.0 g/L of sodium dihydrogen phosphate (NaH<2>PO<4>); and
d. about 10-150 g/L of a beta cyclodextrin.

a. about 8 g/L of sodium chloride (NaCl);
b. about 13.8 g/L of disodium phosphate (Na<2>HPO<4>);
